# Normalize line endings: LF in the repo and on every checkout. Found the hard way on 2026-09-09 — a Windows
# checkout produced CRLF files, and vitest's transform of an imported .mjs failed with "Invalid or unexpected
# token" while the identical LF files passed locally and in Linux CI.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets — never rewrite
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.pdf binary
